<title>USA: Walshire sets 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Walshire sets 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walshire Assurance Co said on Tuesday it set a 10 percent stock dividend payable on or about December 26 to holders of record on December 11.</p>
<p>Cash would be paid in lieu of issuing fractional shares, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it also declared its regular quarterly dividend of $0.065 per share, payable on or about December 26 to holders of record on December 11.</p>
<p>The stock dividend would be paid immediately after the cash dividend was paid, Walshire said.</p>
